WEBVTT

00:07:39.338 --> 00:07:42.456
Now look at the other;
it doesn't forget to eat, of course.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.742
(Laughter)

00:07:45.677 --> 00:07:47.894
This was the cooperation
and reciprocity part.

00:07:47.918 --> 00:07:49.137
Now something on empathy.

00:07:49.161 --> 00:07:51.665
Empathy is my main topic
at the moment, of research.

00:07:51.689 --> 00:07:53.137
And empathy has two qualities:

00:07:53.161 --> 00:07:55.180
One is the understanding part of it.

00:07:55.204 --> 00:07:56.835
This is just a regular definition:

00:07:56.859 --> 00:07:59.671
the ability to understand and share
the feelings of another.

00:07:59.695 --> 00:08:00.904
And the emotional part.